== b20_payload
  san:    exit 134 use after scope closed: storage a closed scope gave back was read or written|
  O3:     exit 0 payload 12|payload 12849|
  interp: exit 1 olang interpret: b20_payload.olang:36: it uses storage after the scope it was made in closed|
--- compile (-debug -sanitize)
built ./build/b20_payload.debug.san
--- run san
use after scope closed: storage a closed scope gave back was read or written
--- run O3
payload 12
payload 12849
--- interpret
olang interpret: b20_payload.olang:36: it uses storage after the scope it was made in closed
